{
  "fixture_version": "1.1",
  "base_fixture": "fixtures/demo-trip.json",
  "detector_entry": "algorithm.conflict_detector.detect",
  "notes": [
    "mutations 采用点路径：members.m01.budget_cap；数组元素用 id 索引。",
    "op 缺省为 set，delete 表示移除该字段。",
    "expect.reasons 只声明必须存在的原因，断言时先按 (rule_id, member_ids[0]) 排序再逐项比对。",
    "expect.reasons_count = 0 时必须断言 reasons 为空数组，不是 null。",
    "所有时间（成员窗、候选全程、节点）一律带 +08:00，不带偏移视为格式非法。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "TC-001",
      "title": "基线：m01 承担 81 元，超上限 1 元",
      "candidate_id": "c01",
      "mutations": [],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          {
            "rule_id": "R-BUD-01",
            "member_ids": ["m01"],
            "field": "cost_per_member.m01",
            "actual": 8100,
            "threshold": 8000
          }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-002",
      "title": "基线：c02 广场与展览可行",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-003",
      "title": "基线：c03 室内手作可行",
      "candidate_id": "c03",
      "mutations": [],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-004",
      "title": "边界：候选结束时间等于共同窗右端，算完整落入",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "forbid_rule_ids": ["R-TIME-01", "R-TIME-02"],
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-005",
      "title": "边界：共同窗右端提前 1 分钟，候选超出即不可行",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        {
          "path": "members.m03.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T13:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T16:59:00+08:00" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          {
            "rule_id": "R-TIME-01",
            "member_ids": ["m03"],
            "actual": "2026-11-21T17:00:00+08:00",
            "threshold": "2026-11-21T16:59:00+08:00"
          }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-006",
      "title": "共同可用窗为空集",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        {
          "path": "members.m04.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T18:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T19:00:00+08:00" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TIME-02", "member_ids": ["m04"] }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "note": "归因规则：谁的任何一段（合并后）空闲都装不下候选，就报谁。m04 全程缺席，其余三人的窗都装得下候选。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-007",
      "title": "同一成员的相邻窗合并：13:30–15:00 与 15:00–18:00 视为连续可用",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        {
          "path": "members.m02.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T13:30:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T15:00:00+08:00" },
            { "start": "2026-11-21T15:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T18:00:00+08:00" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "forbid_rule_ids": ["R-TIME-01", "R-TIME-02"],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "note": "任务书第 2 条：成员内部按并集合并重叠或相邻区间。若实现改成『相接不合并』，本用例会误判为 infeasible。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-008",
      "title": "边界：承担额等于上限，算通过",
      "candidate_id": "c01",
      "mutations": [{ "path": "members.m01.budget_cap", "value": 8100 }],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "forbid_rule_ids": ["R-BUD-01"],
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-009",
      "title": "多原因全部收集，不早停",
      "candidate_id": "c01",
      "mutations": [
        { "path": "members.m02.allowed_transport", "value": ["bus"] }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 2,
        "reasons": [
          {
            "rule_id": "R-BUD-01",
            "member_ids": ["m01"],
            "actual": 8100,
            "threshold": 8000
          },
          {
            "rule_id": "R-TRANS-01",
            "member_ids": ["m02"],
            "field": "c01-n01"
          }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "note": "排序后顺序必须是 R-BUD-01 在 R-TRANS-01 之前；若实现按发现顺序输出，此例失败。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-010",
      "title": "交通方式被拒，逐段查、只报一条、指向第一段",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        { "path": "members.m03.allowed_transport", "value": ["walk"] }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TRANS-01", "member_ids": ["m03"], "field": "c02-n01" }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-011",
      "title": "地点标签命中禁忌，其他候选不受影响",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [{ "path": "members.m04.taboo_tags", "value": ["gallery"] }],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TABOO-01", "member_ids": ["m04"], "field": "c02-n03" }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "companion_assertions": [
        { "candidate_id": "c01", "status": "infeasible", "reasons_count": 1 },
        { "candidate_id": "c03", "status": "feasible", "reasons_count": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-012",
      "title": "缺字段压过不可行：c01 应由 infeasible 变为 incomplete",
      "candidate_id": "c01",
      "mutations": [{ "path": "members.m02.budget_cap", "op": "delete" }],
      "expect": {
        "status": "incomplete",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": [{ "member_id": "m02", "field": "budget_cap", "rule_id": "R-DATA-01" }]
      },
      "note": "优先级用例。若实现先跑预算，会输出 R-BUD-01 并判 infeasible，虽然看着合理，但会把用户引去换方案而不是补表单。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-013",
      "title": "口径未定：预算未声明含不含往返",
      "candidate_id": "c01",
      "mutations": [{ "path": "members.m01.budget_basis", "op": "delete" }],
      "expect": {
        "status": "incomplete",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": [{ "member_id": "m01", "field": "budget_basis", "rule_id": "R-DATA-02" }]
      },
      "note": "去掉了 budget_basis 就无法判断 8000 分是不是含往返，结论不可比，只能先补口径。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-014",
      "title": "软偏好不参与判定：改兴趣，三卡状态逐字不变",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        { "path": "members.m01.interest_tags", "value": ["craft", "outdoor"] }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "companion_assertions": [
        { "candidate_id": "c01", "status": "infeasible", "reasons_count": 1 },
        { "candidate_id": "c03", "status": "feasible", "reasons_count": 0 }
      ],
      "note": "兴趣一旦进入过滤，三卡会全灭，产品退化成推荐器。这条守的是产品边界，不是代码 bug。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-015",
      "title": "同一输入连跑两次，输出逐字一致",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [],
      "repeat": 2,
      "expect": {
        "status": "feasible",
        "identical_serialization": true,
        "identical_fingerprint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-016",
      "title": "变更后 v2 超出共同窗，G3 不得生成预览",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mode": "resolved_trip",
      "trip": {
        "version": "v2",
        "based_on": "v1",
        "overrides": [
          {
            "replaces": "c02-n04",
            "node": {
              "node_id": "c02-n04-r1",
              "start": "2026-11-21T16:30:00+08:00",
              "end": "2026-11-21T17:20:00+08:00",
              "kind": "transit",
              "transport": "metro"
            },
            "reason": "替代方案返程延后"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TIME-01", "member_ids": ["m03"] }
        ],
        "missing_fields": [],
        "preview_allowed": false
      },
      "companion_assertions": [
        {
          "candidate_id": "c02",
          "field": "nodes.c02-n04.end",
          "unchanged_value": "2026-11-21T17:00:00+08:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-017",
      "title": "同一成员留了 5 分钟空档（14:55–15:00）就不合并，候选装不进",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        {
          "path": "members.m02.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T13:30:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T14:55:00+08:00" },
            { "start": "2026-11-21T15:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T18:00:00+08:00" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TIME-01", "member_ids": ["m02"] }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "note": "要留返校或赶路时间，就把那段空档写进可用窗；写了空档就不能要求候选跨过它。与 TC-007 成对：端点重合合并、有真空档不合并。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-018",
      "title": "不同成员只在端点相碰（15:00）不产生共同可用时长",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        {
          "path": "members.m01.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T13:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T15:00:00+08:00" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "members.m02.available_windows",
          "value": [
            { "start": "2026-11-21T15:00:00+08:00", "end": "2026-11-21T18:00:00+08:00" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "infeasible",
        "reasons_count": 1,
        "reasons": [
          { "rule_id": "R-TIME-02", "member_ids": ["m01", "m02"] }
        ],
        "missing_fields": []
      },
      "note": "任务书第 2 条：仅端点相碰没有正时长。若交集实现漏掉『必需正时长』，会算出一段 15:00–15:00 的假共同窗。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "TC-019",
      "title": "节点时间写成 HH:MM（不带偏移）判格式非法，不猜时区",
      "candidate_id": "c02",
      "mutations": [
        { "path": "candidates.c02.nodes.c02-n02.start", "value": "14:00" }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": "incomplete",
        "reasons_count": 0,
        "missing_fields": [
          { "member_id": null, "field": "nodes.c02-n02", "rule_id": "R-DATA-01" }
        ]
      },
      "note": "同一条规则覆盖『HH:MM』与『缺 nodes』两种：格式非法或缺字段都先判 incomplete，再谈可行不可行。"
    }
  ]
}
